TetherCam notices
==================

TetherCam drives the official scrcpy client at runtime. scrcpy is:

  Copyright (C) 2018 Genymobile
  Copyright (C) 2018-2026 Romain Vimont
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy

The only official source for scrcpy is https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy.
TetherCam never bundles scrcpy binaries: install.sh downloads the official
release tarball and verifies its sha256 before first use, so you always get
upstream code, not a forked copy.

v4l2loopback (GPLv2, https://github.com/umlaeute/v4l2loopback) is used only
via its kernel module interface already present on the host; no v4l2loopback
code is included here.
